<section class="manifesto" id="manifesto">

    <div class="container">

        <div class="section-header">

            <span class="section-label">
                THE MANIFESTO
            </span>

            <h2>
                Written On The Blockchain. Forever.
            </h2>

        </div>

        <div class="manifesto-body">

            <!-- I. INTRODUCTION -->

            <article class="manifesto-item">

                <span class="manifesto-index">I.</span>

                <div>
                    <h3>Introduction: The Crisis of Trust</h3>
                    <p>
                        Trust in crypto is broken. Endless scam projects. Promises without delivery.
                        Creators who disappear after the sale. Liquidity pools that turn out to be
                        traps.
                    </p>
                    <p>
                        L3G3NDARY is built differently — not as another NFT drop, not as a meme token,
                        not as a quick cash grab. As something that will remain after us. As legacy.
                    </p>
                </div>

            </article>

            <!-- II. FOUNDATIONS -->

            <article class="manifesto-item">

                <span class="manifesto-index">II.</span>

                <div>
                    <h3>Foundations: The Architecture of Trust</h3>
                    <p>
                        The core contracts in the L3G3NDARY ecosystem are renounced:
                    </p>

                    <div class="manifesto-badges">
                        <span>LGND Token <em>Renounced</em></span>
                        <span>L3G3NDARY Pass Staking <em>Renounced</em></span>
                        <span>L3G3NDS Staking <em>Renounced</em></span>
                    </div>

                    <p>
                        This means no one can change the rules. The contracts work as written —
                        forever. No ability to disable staking, no hidden "take everything" buttons,
                        no creator control.
                    </p>
                    <p>
                        <strong>80% of 1,000,000,000 LGND</strong> are locked, burned, or in staking
                        contracts. Only <strong>20%</strong> are in circulation. Liquidity is locked
                        forever — LP tokens are burned.
                    </p>
                    <p>
                        All contracts can be verified on the website and on-chain. Addresses, statuses,
                        transactions — everything is public.
                    </p>
                </div>

            </article>

            <!-- III. THE FLYWHEEL -->

            <article class="manifesto-item">

                <span class="manifesto-index">III.</span>

                <div>
                    <h3>The Flywheel: How It Works</h3>
                    <p>
                        The L3G3NDARY ecosystem is built around a simple formula:
                    </p>

                    <ul class="manifesto-list">
                        <li>NFTs sold (primary sale) — <strong>100%</strong> of funds → into LGND liquidity pool</li>
                        <li>NFTs resold (secondary market) — <strong>50%</strong> of royalties → into LGND liquidity pool</li>
                        <li>You buy LGND → you increase liquidity</li>
                        <li>You stake NFTs → you earn LGND</li>
                    </ul>

                    <p>
                        This is a closed loop: buy NFT → funds go to liquidity → token grows → stake NFT
                        → earn token → ecosystem strengthens.
                    </p>
                </div>

            </article>

            <!-- IV. COLLECTIONS -->

            <article class="manifesto-item">

                <span class="manifesto-index">IV.</span>

                <div>
                    <h3>Collections: Art and Utility</h3>
                    <p>
                        Each collection in the L3G3NDARY ecosystem has its own role.
                    </p>

                    <div class="manifesto-collections">

                        <div class="manifesto-collection">
                            <span class="manifesto-collection-num">1</span>
                            <div>
                                <h4>Ancient Greek Coin</h4>
                                <p>
                                    The heart of the project. 444 NFTs, each with a unique story. Each
                                    character has an individual legend, each legend holds a key-word
                                    that is part of a single message. 444 stories → 444 keys → 1
                                    message.
                                </p>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <div class="manifesto-collection">
                            <span class="manifesto-collection-num">2</span>
                            <div>
                                <h4>AI Mosaics L3g3nds</h4>
                                <p>
                                    A collection of pure art, where utility does not overshadow meaning
                                    — for those who value aesthetics and history, not just passive
                                    income. It does not participate in staking, but remains part of the
                                    ecosystem.
                                </p>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <div class="manifesto-collection">
                            <span class="manifesto-collection-num">3</span>
                            <div>
                                <h4>L3G3NDARY Pass</h4>
                                <p>
                                    555 NFT tickets into the ecosystem. Access to a private Discord
                                    channel, free mint of each new collection, and airdrops of LGND
                                    tokens.
                                </p>
                                <span class="manifesto-collection-rate">Staking: 2,500 LGND / day</span>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <div class="manifesto-collection">
                            <span class="manifesto-collection-num">4</span>
                            <div>
                                <h4>L3G3NDS</h4>
                                <p>
                                    1,111 NFTs. Staked → generate stable income in LGND.
                                </p>
                                <span class="manifesto-collection-rate">Staking: 1,000 LGND / day</span>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <div class="manifesto-collection">
                            <span class="manifesto-collection-num">5</span>
                            <div>
                                <h4>L3G3NDARY Elite</h4>
                                <p>
                                    777 unique NFTs, created in different qualities and styles using AI.
                                </p>
                                <span class="manifesto-collection-rate">Staking: 777 LGND / day</span>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                    </div>

                </div>

            </article>

            <!-- V. THE GALLERY -->

            <article class="manifesto-item">

                <span class="manifesto-index">V.</span>

                <div>
                    <h3>The Gallery: A Museum on the Blockchain</h3>
                    <p>
                        Ancient Greek Coin Gallery — a public museum where NFTs with stories are
                        collected. This is not just a collection. This is architecture of meaning.
                    </p>

                    <div class="manifesto-stats">

                        <div class="manifesto-stat">
                            <strong>292 / 444</strong>
                            <span>NFTs in the gallery</span>
                        </div>

                        <div class="manifesto-stat">
                            <strong>23+</strong>
                            <span>Keys found</span>
                        </div>

                        <div class="manifesto-stat">
                            <strong>📜</strong>
                            <span>The message has begun to reveal itself</span>
                        </div>

                    </div>

                </div>

            </article>

            <!-- VI. SALES MODEL -->

            <article class="manifesto-item">

                <span class="manifesto-index">VI.</span>

                <div>
                    <h3>Sales Model: Transparency</h3>
                    <p>
                        Everything sold from the project wallet and gallery goes toward ecosystem
                        development. <strong>5%</strong> from each resale strengthens the token's
                        liquidity.
                    </p>

                    <ul class="manifesto-list">
                        <li>Every sale is explained in advance</li>
                        <li>Transactions are public</li>
                        <li>The purpose is clear</li>
                    </ul>

                    <p>
                        This is not an exit. This is building.
                    </p>
                </div>

            </article>

            <!-- VII. WEBSITE AND CONTROL -->

            <article class="manifesto-item">

                <span class="manifesto-index">VII.</span>

                <div>
                    <h3>Website and Control</h3>
                    <p>
                        All information about the project, contracts, staking, and collections is on
                        the website:
                        <a href="https://l3g3ndary.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">l3g3ndary.com</a>
                    </p>

                    <ul class="manifesto-list">
                        <li>Addresses of all contracts</li>
                        <li>Proof of renouncement</li>
                        <li>Liquidity status</li>
                        <li>Direct links to Etherscan</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>

            </article>

            <!-- VIII. CONCLUSION -->

            <article class="manifesto-item">

                <span class="manifesto-index">VIII.</span>

                <div>
                    <h3>Conclusion: Legacy</h3>
                    <p>
                        Most projects say "community first" and chase hype. L3G3NDARY is built
                        differently.
                    </p>

                    <ul class="manifesto-list">
                        <li>Every NFT sold → liquidity grows</li>
                        <li>Every stake → ecosystem strengthens</li>
                        <li>Every contract → renounced forever</li>
                        <li>Every promise → fulfilled</li>
                    </ul>

                    <p>
                        No empty promises. Only completed steps and full transparency. 444 stories
                        written on the blockchain — not for today. For what will remain after us.
                    </p>
                </div>

            </article>

        </div>

        <div class="manifesto-quote">

            <p>
                "Most stories fade like footprints in sand. Empires rise, they crush mountains, they
                build walls that touch the sky. And then time comes…"
            </p>

            <span class="manifesto-signoff">This is L3G3NDARY.</span>

        </div>

    </div>

</section>

